<li class=" "><a href="/tour/page.do?mnu_uid=2563&amp;" target="_self"  class=""><span>황오&amp;구황동 속살걷기</span></a></li>
<li class="active"><a href="/tour/page.do?mnu_uid=2564&amp;" target="_self"  class=""><span>동부동 속살걷기</span></a></li>
